OL,3,GNEWSAHomes without water and roads
OL,4,Aclosed after burst pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes in parts of Crawley
OL,7,Fhave water supply issues and a number
OL,8,Fof roads have flooded after what police
OL,9,Fare describing as a "significant" leak.
OL,11,FRoads around the Southgate Roundabout
OL,12,Fin Crawley have been closed on Sunday
OL,13,Fmorning due to the burst water pipe,
OL,14,FSussex Police said.
OL,16,FSouthern Water said around 9,000
OL,17,Fcustomers were impacted and it was
OL,18,Fsetting up bottled water stations.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
